{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1711238400, "end_date": 1711929599, "month_true_total": 405, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:51:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "161906643", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060372432", "personaname": "The High Table", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/The_High_Table/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 903, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 738, "last_played": 1772648115, "avatar": "08fa5829cd640dafed8d94de1e117e321eeaba39"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mid-tier game that mimics Left 4 Dead in some positive aspects but is disappointingly watered down with nuance and unnecessary systems that do not belong in a game that tries to bring forward the idea of Left 4 Dead to more modern hardware. If you consider buying this, wait for sale.", "timestamp_created": 1711916234, "timestamp_updated": 1711916234, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5249289870262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161905270", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138534592", "personaname": "Clutch Master", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198138534592/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 52545, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42167, "last_played": 1776018161, "avatar": "5b8825b34c5d77b00c3a18897f2f1175fa0e0e57"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1711914701, "timestamp_updated": 1711914701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161897574", "author": {"steamid": "76561199193695715", "personaname": "NIIIHGHANROW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199193695715/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7423, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4533, "last_played": 1764741690, "avatar": "7cfb49def0658068d00f72bb2245dc1738756185"}, "language": "english", "review": "Definetely a good zombie shooter game. me and the boys finished the whole game (including the DLC's act 5 and 6) in just 4 days. if you're really into the story, I recommend to just watch a whole game play in Youtube. But if you have some spare bucks you can also enjoy the remaining DLC acts by yourself or with your friends for the experience too. A lot of people are saying that the game is too short, but well I agree on that. After playing the game Campaign mode you feel like you're done. But in the other hand, you can try to play the campaign in nightmare mode to challenge yourself and play more card decks to maximize your potential power. There are also a lot of achievements to accomplish in exchange for rewards in game. Well, is it worth to buy the game full price? -No. Buy the game when it's on sale including the DLC's. It's a fun game, a lot relatable to L4D2 tbh, but a lot more complicated which is fun.", "timestamp_created": 1711906939, "timestamp_updated": 1711906939, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161895670", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960893592", "personaname": "Cronik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197960893592/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 5484, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5238, "last_played": 1770566639, "avatar": "c5a59e55add9d8f97e943331478c99e0d5f8e861"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very underrated coop horde shooter most likely because of the card system which took some brain power, playing with randoms could be very frustrating in the early months, the high price point on release for a limited number of campaign levels and the lack of a versus pvp campaign and mod support like left 4 dead was famed for.\n\nDespite the points above once the game released all of it's dlc campaigns, fixed some balance issues, the casual players leaving and the price point dropped it was very much worth playing.", "timestamp_created": 1711905067, "timestamp_updated": 1711905067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161889008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198372634893", "personaname": "Emerald_N8", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198372634893/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4394, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2234, "last_played": 1713272587, "avatar": "78912cd1244b575810ca6ef055457968274a2236"}, "language": "english", "review": "recommended when on sale", "timestamp_created": 1711898705, "timestamp_updated": 1711898705, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": fa